#. そうだ…<CLT 3>『彼らのように殺される』<CLT>なんて発言は、
#. あの時のセレスさんから、出て来るはずないんだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right... There's no reason Celeste should have\n"
"said \"<CLT 3>just like *those guys* died<CLT>\"..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、あの時、ボクらはまだセレスさんに、
#. 石丸クンの件を伝えてなかったはずだよ？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When she said that, none of us had told her Taka was\n"
"dead."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. しかも、俺達がセレスと会ったのは、
#. 廊下に出た後の事だ。
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Exactly. And we didn't run into her until after we\n"
"were all out in the hall."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、そいつには物理準備室の死体を見る機会も
#. なかったはずだ…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So there was never any chance for her to have seen his\n"
"body in the equipment room for herself."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに、セレスさんはどうして知っていたの？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So how did you know, Celeste?"
msgstr ""

#. 殺されたのは１人じゃなくて<CLT 3>“彼ら”<CLT>…
#. しかも<CLT 3>“男”<CLT>だったって事をさ…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How did you know <CLT 3>more than one person<CLT> had been\n"
"killed? And how did you know they were <CLT 3>both guys<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、あの時は霧切さんも姿を消してたんだ。
#. 彼女が殺された可能性だって、あったはずだよ？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because Kyoko had also disappeared, right? So she\n"
"could have been dead, too."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うふふふ…
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm..."
msgstr ""

#. みなさん、想像力が豊かなのですね？
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid "You all have such vivid imaginations, you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. 想像…だと…？
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Imaginations...?"
msgstr ""

#. 先程、あなた方はおっしゃっていましたわね？
#. わたくしが不審者を目撃した証言は、すべてウソだと…
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You claim that I was lying when I told you about the\n"
"suspicious person I saw..."
msgstr ""

#. でしたら、この画像はどうなるのです？
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Then what about the picture I took?"
msgstr ""

#. 不審者が山田君を連れ去っている、この画像について、
#. みなさんは、どう説明を付けるおつもりですか？
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid ""
"How do you explain this picture of the costumed\n"
"villain dragging Hifumi away?"
msgstr ""

#. それも…ねつ造だろ…？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I-It has to be some kind of setup, right?"
msgstr ""

#. セレスっちが、あの衣装を着て…
#. そんで…デジカメのタイマーを使って撮影したとか…
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Celeste put the suit on, and then...then she used the\n"
"camera's timer to...to set up the picture!"
msgstr ""

#. お忘れですか？　あの衣装は、
#. 葉隠君にしか着られないはずですわよ？
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Have you so quickly forgotten? You are the only one\n"
"who could have possibly fit into that suit."
msgstr ""

#. それに…このデジカメには、
#. タイマー機能なんて付いておりません。
msgctxt "0019 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Plus, I happen to know that this particular camera\n"
"does not have a timer."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、不審者が山田君を連れ去ったというのは、
#. 揺るぎない事実なのです。
msgctxt "0020 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In other words, it is an unassailable fact that this\n"
"is a picture of Hifumi being dragged away."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしの証言がすべてウソだと言うなら、
#. この画像がなんなのかを、説明して頂けますか？
msgctxt "0021 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If everything I told you was a lie, how can this\n"
"picture exist?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、その画像って本当に…
#. 不審者が山田君を連れ去っているところなのかしら？
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Simple. Are we sure that's really a picture of the\n"
"suspect dragging Hifumi away?"
msgstr ""

#. …どういう意味ですか？
msgctxt "0023 | CELES"
msgid "...What could you possibly mean by that?"
msgstr ""

#. 不審者が山田君を連れ去った訳じゃなくて…
#. 他の可能性だってあるんじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Surely there are other explanations than the one\n"
"you've offered up."
msgstr ""

#. 他の可能性なんて…ある訳ないですわ…
msgctxt "0025 | CELES"
msgid "No...there is no other explanation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他の…可能性…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Other...explanations?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 山田が不審者を連れ去っている
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Hifumi is dragging the suspect away"
msgstr ""

#. 山田と不審者が踊っている
msgctxt "0028 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Hifumi and the suspect are dancing"
msgstr ""

#. あら、うふふふ…
#. 言われてみれば、そう見えなくもないですわね。
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Huh? Hmhmhm. Yes, I suppose in a certain light, you\n"
"could interpret it that way."
msgstr ""

#. ふざけてるの…？
#. まさか、本気じゃないでしょ…？
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Is this some kind of bad joke? Surely you can't be\n"
"serious..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違ったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess I was wrong...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 山田と不審者は酔っ払っている
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Hifumi and the suspect had been drinking"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、ちょっと違う気が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Um, no...I really don't think that's right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いくら考えても無駄ですわ。
#. だって、他の可能性なんてありませんもの。
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Take all the time you want to think about it, there is\n"
"no point. Because there is no other possibility."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、きっと他の可能性があるはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, you're wrong... There has to be!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンが単なる被害者ではなく、
#. 共犯者だったのなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi wasn't just an innocent victim—he was also an\n"
"accomplice!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不審者が山田クンを連れ去っているところを、
#. 撮影した画像じゃないとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If it wasn't a picture of the suspect dragging Hifumi\n"
"away...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、それ以外の可能性って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the only other possibility is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれは、不審者が、
#. 山田クンを連れ去ってる画像じゃなくって…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's *not* a picture of the suspect dragging Hifumi\n"
"away..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンの方が、
#. <CLT 3>不審者を連れ去ってる画像<CLT>だったのかもしれないね？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I would say it's a picture of <CLT 3>Hifumi dragging the\n"
"suspect away<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. く…！！
msgctxt "0044 | CELES"
msgid "Kh—!"
msgstr ""

#. …そう考えられるはずよ。
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's certainly within the realm of possibility."
msgstr ""

#. あの画像で連れ去られていたのは、
#. 山田君の方ではなく不審者の方だった…
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The one being dragged off in that picture isn't\n"
"Hifumi, but the person in the robot suit."
msgstr ""

#. それを、私達が勘違いしていただけなのかも。
#. 山田君の方が連れ去られたんだって…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We've simply been led to believe that it's the other\n"
"way around."
msgstr ""

#. あの怪しい衣裳も、
#. 私達に勘違いさせる為の物だったんじゃないかしら。
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And the strange costume might only exist to lead us\n"
"astray even farther."
msgstr ""

#. あんな衣裳を着ている人物を見たら、
#. 誰だって、そっちが怪しいと思い込んでしまうからね…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you saw someone wearing something like that in this\n"
"situation, of course you'd notice and be suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうやって、俺の寝てる間に、
#. 俺を容疑者に仕立て上げたんだな！
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Th-That's what happened! You put me to sleep and made\n"
"me out to be the bad guy in all this!"
msgstr ""

#. うふ…うふふふふ…
msgctxt "0051 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhm. Hmhmhmhm..."
msgstr ""

#. うふふ…そんな訳…
msgctxt "0052 | CELES"
msgid "Eheh... Such a thing..."
msgstr ""

#. …ないじゃありませんか。
msgctxt "0053 | CELES"
msgid "...is utterly impossible."
msgstr ""

#. 山田君の方が不審者を連れ去っていた？
#. そんな事、あり得ませんわ…
msgctxt "0054 | CELES"
msgid "Hifumi was dragging him away? Ridiculous."
msgstr ""

#. あり得ない…本当にそうかしら？
#. 私にはそうは思えないけど…
msgctxt "0055 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is it? I don't think it's ridiculous at all."
msgstr ""

#. でしたら、お教えしましょうか。
#. あり得ないと言い切れる根拠を…
msgctxt "0056 | CELES"
msgid "Then shut your mouth and allow me to educate you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンが不審者を連れ去った事はあり得ない。
#. そう言い切れる根拠なんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste thinks she can prove that there's no way\n"
"Hifumi was dragging the suspect away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなものが…本当にあるのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But is that really possible...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
